  "clarification": "The native runtime exposes the existing scoped tool definitions readProject,proposeEdits,discoverAssets,discoverPacks,readPack,readSource,searchSources,captureSource,registerComponent,readAsset. captureSource and registerComponent can retain canonical assets; they are not paid provider tools. The original wording only scoped reads/proposals was too narrow for the actual shipped registry. No narration/experiment/render/publish tools are exposed. Request bodies retain this exact existing registry; no harness-only tool removal. This clarification requires coordinator review before paid execution.",
